meta {
  name: Payment Links E2E 9 - Amount Over Balance is 400
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/agency/invoices/{{plInvAId}}/payment-link
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "amount": 100001
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 400
  res.body.code: eq "PAYMENT_LINK_AMOUNT_EXCEEDS_BALANCE"
}

docs {
  §36/§37 — THE server-resolves-the-amount rule: a browser amount may only
  NARROW the collection (an explicit partial). 100001 against a 100000
  outstanding balance is a 400 BEFORE the gateway is ever contacted — the
  browser's number is never the source of truth. A ₹1 link claiming to be
  the collection against a ₹100,000 invoice is impossible by construction.
}
